**\n\nAlternatively, we can actually carry out the process of adding the complex number and its conjugate.\n\nTo obtain the conjugate of the complex number $z=4+7\\text{i},$ we flip the sign of the imaginary part and get $\\overset{―}{z}=4-7\\text{i}.$\n\nAdding, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z+\\overset{―}{z} & =(4+7\\text{i})+(4-7\\text{i}) \\\\  & =(4+4)+\\text{i}(7-7) \\\\  & =8+\\text{i}0 \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264874 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264875 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264876 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264877 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264878 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1041 "selection" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1104 #edb/ref 17592186264875 13194139533903 true] [17592186264873 1110 #uuid "a5fd970f-898a-5707-aad9-e3983188c49f" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264874 1034 "13" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264874 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533903 true] [17592186264874 1111 #uuid "402c6b2d-0ac1-5c1a-b38a-5ba938f1ce74" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264875 1034 "8" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264875 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533903 true] [17592186264875 1111 #uuid "fa580ef5-7b15-581d-93d6-0d9fbfb79fba" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264876 1034 "14\\text{i}" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264876 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533903 true] [17592186264876 1111 #uuid "eefc7ef9-5e52-5cbb-ba38-16df4cea56d9" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264877 1034 "4" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264877 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533903 true] [17592186264877 1111 #uuid "7594410a-7f01-5c04-a747-38ae6d639cf9" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264878 1034 "8+14\\text{i}" 13194139533903 true] [17592186264878 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533903 true] [17592186264878 1